
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>My Snapchat Page</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #FFFC00;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: white;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 380px;
            padding: 40px 25px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .ghost {
            font-size: 80px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #111111;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #555555;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #111111;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background-color: #333333;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777777;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="card">

        <div class="ghost">👻</div>

        <h1>Welcome to My Snapchat</h1>

        <p>
            Welcome to my little Snapchat-inspired page!
            Stay connected and have fun.
        </p>

        <a
            href="https://www.snapchat.com"
            target="_blank"
            class="button"
        >
            Open Snapchat
        </a>

        <div class="footer">
            Made with 💛
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>

